title: "A-Life Singularity x Clean-Slate v3.0 Omega Package: A Zero-Mathlib Lean 4.35.0 Model of Integer Scoring Invariants, a 748-Run Paired Simulation Study, and a 1,900-Problem Atlas Crosswalk"
